# CODEOWNERS — The Holding Company
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/articles/about-code-owners
# Owners here are REQUIRED reviewers once branch protection enables
# "Require review from Code Owners". Last matching pattern wins.
#
# Least privilege: prefer TEAM handles over individuals so access is
# managed by team membership, not scattered across files. A team named
# here must have at least WRITE (push) access to the repo, or GitHub
# ignores it as an owner.

# ---- Default owner (everything not matched below) -------------------
*                       @The-Holding-Company/ops @chrisbergeron

# ---- CI / automation: highest blast radius, tightest ownership ------
/.github/               @The-Holding-Company/ops @chrisbergeron
/.github/workflows/     @The-Holding-Company/ops @chrisbergeron

# ---- Infrastructure as code ----------------------------------------
*.tf                    @The-Holding-Company/ops @chrisbergeron
*.tfvars                @The-Holding-Company/ops @chrisbergeron
/terraform/             @The-Holding-Company/ops @chrisbergeron
/deploy/                @The-Holding-Company/ops @chrisbergeron
Dockerfile              @The-Holding-Company/ops @chrisbergeron
docker-compose*.yml     @The-Holding-Company/ops @chrisbergeron
*.tf.json               @The-Holding-Company/ops @chrisbergeron

# ---- Secrets / policy surfaces (should rarely change; require review)
/.gitleaks.toml         @The-Holding-Company/ops @chrisbergeron
/SECURITY.md            @The-Holding-Company/ops @chrisbergeron
/.github/dependabot.yml @The-Holding-Company/ops @chrisbergeron
*.rego                  @The-Holding-Company/ops @chrisbergeron
